      "slug": "magic-ring-basket",
      "term": "Magic ring",
      "definition": "An adjustable loop start for working in the round. Pull the tail to close the centre hole completely. Gives a neat flat base with no central hole."
    },
    {
      "slug": "dc-spiral",
      "term": "Spiral rounds",
      "definition": "Working in a continuous spiral without joining rounds with a slip stitch. Mark the first stitch of each round with a stitch marker to track progress."
    },
    {
      "slug": "weaving-in-ends",
      "term": "Weaving in ends",
