  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A basic round basket is 20 cm across and 12 cm tall. It starts with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-basket"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and grows in "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc-spiral"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "spiral rounds"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " until the base reaches 20 cm, then the sides work straight up."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Super-chunky cotton rope or t-shirt yarn on a 10 mm hook gives a rigid basket. Thinner rope is softer and more flexible. Total yardage is around 150 m of super-chunky rope."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Super-chunky cotton rope or t-shirt yarn",
              "qty": "150 m"
            },
            {
              "name": "10 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Stitch marker",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Base (rounds 1 to 7)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: Magic ring, 8 dc. Pull ring closed. Place marker. (8 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2: 2 dc into every stitch. (16 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 3: *1 dc, 2 dc into next*. Repeat. (24 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 4: *1 dc, 1 dc, 2 dc into next*. Repeat. (32 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 5: *1 dc x 3, 2 dc into next*. Repeat. (40 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 6: *1 dc x 4, 2 dc into next*. Repeat. (48 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 7: *1 dc x 5, 2 dc into next*. Repeat. (56 dc.) Check: base should measure about 20 cm across."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sides (rounds 8 onward)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 8: Work 1 dc into the back loop only of every stitch around. This creates a sharp fold line between base and sides. (56 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rounds 9 to 18: Work 1 dc into every stitch around in spiral (both loops). Continue until sides measure 12 cm. Sl st to next stitch to close final round. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Secure tails with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "weaving-in-ends"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "weaving in ends"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Place a flat heavy book inside while the basket is damp to even the base."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Care"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Spot clean cotton rope. Machine wash only if the label allows. Shape while damp."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What to try next"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The oval basket uses the same technique from an oval base. Or try the tall round basket for a deeper version of this shape."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}